Package: libwildlifesystems-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: WildlifeSystems shared sensor utilities - development files
 Static library and headers providing common functionality for
 WildlifeSystems sensor drivers including:
  - JSON string escaping and field replacement
  - sc-prototype interaction for JSON templates
  - Common command handling (identify, list, version)
  - GPIO pin validation
  - Raspberry Pi serial number retrieval
 .
 This package contains the static library and header files needed
 to develop sensor drivers using ws-utils.
